{"metadata": {"team_id": "TREMA_UNH", "run_id": "run_7-task-2", "topic_id": "msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1300032609", "type": "automatic", "use_starter_kit": 1}, "responses": [{"text": "Britney Spears is still under a conservatorship after 15 years, with her father Jamie Spears serving as the primary conservator.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "In August 2020, Britney's court-appointed attorney said she 'strongly opposed' her father's position as the sole conservator of her estate and asked the court to limit his control.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "Britney has remained tight-lipped throughout the legal battle, speaking only through her legal team, but she has expressed feelings of being 'stuck' and lacking excitement in her life.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "Jamie Spears, as the conservator, has control over Britney's estate and medical decisions, according to court documents.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "In November 2020, a judge granted Britney's wish to appoint an outside financial group, Bessemer Trust, as co-conservator of her estate.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "Britney's conservatorship is still in place despite her recent success in managing her career, according to court documents and statements from her legal team.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}, {"text": "Britney's fans have used the hashtag #FreeBritney to bring attention to her legal battle against her father, with many staging protests outside the Los Angeles courthouse where status hearings are held.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1253258532#3_2572775055"]}]}
